3. anthropics/skills — webapp-testing (its with_server.py helper)
   https://github.com/anthropics/skills (skills/webapp-testing)
   Licence: Apache License 2.0
   Inspiration only, no code copied: the idea of a helper that starts the app's servers,
   waits until they answer, runs a command and always stops them. Our own implementation
   is template/.factory/serve-with (also behind `.factory/shoot --serve`).

4. anthropics/claude-plugins-official — pr-review-toolkit (its silent-failure-hunter agent)
   https://github.com/anthropics/claude-plugins-official (plugins/pr-review-toolkit)
   Licence: Apache License 2.0
   Inspiration only, no code or text copied: the idea of reviewing a diff for errors that
   vanish instead of failing. Our own short checklist is the "Silent failures" section of
   template/.claude/agents/factory-reviewer-code.md.

Neither is installed, vendored or loaded at runtime: the factory ships only its own files.
